# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# NOTE: Capacitor's default ignore list also hides App/App/public,
# capacitor.config.json and config.xml — but the Xcode build needs all three,
# and this repo builds from fresh clones on machines that may not run the
# Capacitor CLI. They are committed; `npx cap sync ios` refreshes them.
